          "excerpt": "國亡，入宋禁中。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "nantang-li-yu-palace-qiao-hundred-day-offering",
      "title": "国主百日捨经相国寺",
      "summary": "乔氏闻后主薨，在国主百日捨经相国寺塔院为他祈福，卷后有自述题记。僧人后来携经回江南属于经卷流传，不是她归国。",
      "year": null,
      "sortOrder": 3,
      "precision": "undated",
      "sourceDate": "伏遇国主百日；相对祭奠时点，未有独立确年日",
      "phase": "uncertain",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "chapterId": "shiguochunqiu-v018",
          "paragraphId": "shiguochunqiu-v018-p12",
          "originalRevision": 1,
          "originalSha256": "4cac4c54d6335ffb945ddec489e4b04ad34ba1c82fe130b4997a32ef57f77708",
          "excerpt": "聞後主薨，乃出經捨相國寺，以資冥福"
        },
        {
          "chapterId": "shiguochunqiu-v018",
          "paragraphId": "shiguochunqiu-v018-p12",
          "originalRevision": 1,
          "originalSha256": "4cac4c54d6335ffb945ddec489e4b04ad34ba1c82fe130b4997a32ef57f77708",
          "excerpt": "伏遇國主百日，謹捨昔時賜妾所書《般若心經》在相國寺塔院。"
        }
      ],
      "notes": [
        "不从外部卒日倒算一年或确日。"
      ]
